7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"196CWwMAtAcA21jYiMyRzg","review_id":"zYNjEthyNLRNk0HrZvHbQw","date":"2011-05-16T15:21:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9435964822769165,"text_excerpt":"We tried to go for brunch across the square here to Stanley's, but the line was around the block so we ended up at Cafe Pontalba. What a great meal! We started off with the blackened alligator, which is an absurdly delicious appetizer, served with a side of extremely tasty remoulade for dipping. I think I could eat a pound of blackened alligator. Seriously, this stuff is damn good. For lunch, I had the crawfish po' boy, which was fairly simple yet quite delicious as well. Crispy fried crawfish on a fresh french roll. This sandwich was enhanced quite a bit by a little more of that fantastic remoulade. I also strongly recommend the cajun potatoes, which are basically mashed redskins with so..."},{"business_id":"196CWwMAtAcA21jYiMyRzg","review_id":"9gFUG0ED003KUIJwdoN8mw","date":"2018-03-01T22:15:16","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9300932288169861,"text_excerpt":"Great spot right in Jackson Square to grab some food. They had all the windows and doors open which allowed for a nice breeze as well as for music to pour in from the outside. The service is also very friendly! We got the fried calamari to start, and they were delicious! It came with a tartar sauce as well as cocktail sauce. We also got the seafood platter that came with fries shrimp, fried oysters, crab cakes, fried fish, as well as fries and hush puppies. Everything tasted great, especially the fish which was soft and flaky. Also this is the first time I had fried oysters and they were redally good! I wish there were more hush puppies on the plate cus those were amazing! The platter is ..."},{"business_id":"196CWwMAtAcA21jYiMyRzg","review_id":"l6KOkPHfA55LeOLsyjHQRA","date":"2017-12-29T23:50:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9285040497779846,"text_excerpt":"This is one of my favorite places to eat in New Orleans. I make it a point to get the combination plate with gumbo and Red Beans and rice. They are as good as you will find anywhere in NOLA. The atmosphere is great. We the doors open you can hear the sounds of Jackson Square. I highly recommend this to everyone."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"196CWwMAtAcA21jYiMyRzg","photo_id":"VifJPkp3Bm45cwvn4YqaMg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/VifJPkp3Bm45cwvn4YqaMg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8892967700958252},{"business_id":"196CWwMAtAcA21jYiMyRzg","photo_id":"aVzUrHD81lDwbAeZgxuJWA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/aVzUrHD81lDwbAeZgxuJWA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8711471557617188},{"business_id":"196CWwMAtAcA21jYiMyRzg","photo_id":"5KAxN9pxNeJl52WcZQHJxw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/5KAxN9pxNeJl52WcZQHJxw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8446143269538879},{"business_id":"196CWwMAtAcA21jYiMyRzg","photo_id":"CuwysuEQcwDb-akssHNw1Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/CuwysuEQcwDb-akssHNw1Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8180646896362305},{"business_id":"196CWwMAtAcA21jYiMyRzg","photo_id":"54nOQGG8lPhwkp6LnC9y7w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/54nOQGG8lPhwkp6LnC9y7w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8036041855812073}]},"notebook_case":null}
